{"2700810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VEX MAGE", "steam_appid": 2700810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/e6beb5ab7e75d91cdb88190b5b44c423.avif?t=1769414807\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras_big/e6beb5ab7e75d91cdb88190b5b44c423.webp?t=1769414807 width=1560 height=139 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Devil Daggers and Quake, this lightning-fast shooter hurls you into surreal arenas where speed and precision are everything. Merge spells, cross dimensions, and dance through chaos — alone or together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim your immortality on cross-platform leaderboards. Your name is eternal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vexatious Combat:</strong> Enemies strike from all sides - survive by mastering your movement and aggression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine The Elements:</strong> Assign elemental runes to each hand and fuse them for devastating results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Fire Sessions:</strong> Dive into a rapid-fire campaign of levels that explode with speed, chaos, and pure adrenaline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op &amp; Solo:</strong> Fight alone or with up to two allies. The challenge adapts, so every run is a test of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> Leave your mark and fight your way up the global leaderboards, where only the deadliest rise to the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional VR Support:</strong> Unleash all six degrees of freedom and compete with players from the Meta Quest Platform.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/88fc816234908ac88c93937e9fdcc185.poster.avif?t=1769414807\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/88fc816234908ac88c93937e9fdcc185.webm?t=1769414807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/88fc816234908ac88c93937e9fdcc185.mp4?t=1769414807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Devil Daggers and Quake, this lightning-fast shooter hurls you into surreal arenas where speed and precision are everything. Merge spells, cross dimensions, and dance through chaos — alone or together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim your immortality on cross-platform leaderboards. Your name is eternal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vexatious Combat:</strong> Enemies strike from all sides - survive by mastering your movement and aggression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine The Elements:</strong> Assign elemental runes to each hand and fuse them for devastating results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Fire Sessions:</strong> Dive into a rapid-fire campaign of levels that explode with speed, chaos, and pure adrenaline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op &amp; Solo:</strong> Fight alone or with up to two allies. The challenge adapts, so every run is a test of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> Leave your mark and fight your way up the global leaderboards, where only the deadliest rise to the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional VR Support:</strong> Unleash all six degrees of freedom and compete with players from the Meta Quest Platform.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/88fc816234908ac88c93937e9fdcc185.poster.avif?t=1769414807\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/88fc816234908ac88c93937e9fdcc185.webm?t=1769414807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/88fc816234908ac88c93937e9fdcc185.mp4?t=1769414807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Inspired by Devil Daggers and Quake, this lightning-fast shooter hurls you into surreal arenas where speed and precision are everything. Merge spells, cross dimensions, and dance through chaos — alone or together. Claim your immortality on cross-platform leaderboards. Your name is eternal.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/72902f20a1af2fa8528bfcb1d5d14a2b3621b158/header.jpg?t=1769414807", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/d0ddd56ba3e828f6d732b876490bd6108422dbd4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769414807", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/d0ddd56ba3e828f6d732b876490bd6108422dbd4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769414807", "website": "https://vexmage.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-